                      (    forth6809.asm):02646                                   ; been reached. A colon definition split
                      (    forth6809.asm):02647                                   ; across multiple lines would have every
                      (    forth6809.asm):02648                                   ; word on every line after the first
                      (    forth6809.asm):02649                                   ; interpreted (and, for anything with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):02650                                   ; stack effect, executed) instead of
