DDF3 BDE5DE           (    forth6809.asm):02679                  JSR   CATCH
DDF6 3706             (    forth6809.asm):02680                  PULU  D
DDF8 DDFB             (    forth6809.asm):02681                  STD   QTHROWCODE
DDFA 10830000         (    forth6809.asm):02682                  CMPD  #0
DDFE 273B             (    forth6809.asm):02683                  BEQ   QOK
                      (    forth6809.asm):02684         
DE00 DCF3             (    forth6809.asm):02685                  LDD   QSAVEDP
