                      (    forth6809.asm):02704                  ; instead of interpreting - explaining the observed cascade
                      (    forth6809.asm):02705                  ; where one failed definition (GI5) turned every subsequent,
                      (    forth6809.asm):02706                  ; otherwise-correct test on later lines into further -13/-22
