                      (    forth6809.asm):04673                                   ; path (LEAVE-exit, boundary-exit, and the
                      (    forth6809.asm):04674                                   ; continue-looping path alike), not just the
                      (    forth6809.asm):04675                                   ; two paths that used to reach it.
