                      (    forth6809.asm):06047                                  ; leave set, not the sign of the value just
                      (    forth6809.asm):06048                                  ; popped. TSTA explicitly tests D's high byte
                      (    forth6809.asm):06049                                  ; (bit 7 of A reflects the full 16-bit value's
                      (    forth6809.asm):06050                                  ; sign) immediately before the branch that
                      (    forth6809.asm):06051                                  ; depends on it. Confirmed via MAME debugger:
